earlier_independent_module_prompts.prompt:
Use case: productivity-visual / scientific infographic. Create a beautiful standalone modular visual for a Chinese academic research presentation, not a whole presentation page. Shared art direction: pure white background, navy #0A326B and academic blue #1467AF, pale ice-blue, one restrained coral-red #C93E3E accent. Crisp custom scientific illustration with very subtle 2.5D depth, precise thin lines, refined visual hierarchy and generous whitespace. Meaningful illustrative objects, readable large simplified-Chinese sans-serif labels, minimal text. Premium research-lab visual abstract, calm and intelligent. Do not make an ordinary PowerPoint flowchart of rectangular boxes. No dark background, no neon, no gradients filling the background, no photoreal humans, no cute cartoon robots, no decorative nonsense, no watermarks, no invented numbers or text. Keep every element fully inside generous margins.
Asset A, approximately 2.1:1 landscape canvas. Primary request: visualize a self-improving scientific experiment loop whose external memory learns from both positive and negative evidence.
Main composition: a clear clockwise oval loop of SIX distinct, beautifully illustrated stations, with small elegant blue arrow segments that make the direction unambiguous. In exact clockwise order:
1 "检索经验" represented by magnifier exploring a layered knowledge library;
2 "设计实验" represented by a precise research blueprint and hypothesis;
3 "最小验证" represented by a small checkmark lens with evidence being reused;
4 "并行执行" represented by a compact row of compute chips;
5 "完整评测" represented by a scientific evaluation gauge and evidence sheets;
6 "沉淀经验" represented by verified evidence sheets entering a growing knowledge library.
The loop returns from 沉淀经验 to 检索经验. At the center, a visual stack of evidence papers becoming a concise illuminated knowledge book, with the large exact Chinese text "经验驱动迭代". The central book is the external project memory, not a human brain and not self-modification of the foundation model.
A single concise caption at the bottom, exact text: "证据仍适用 → 复用；关键条件变化 → 定向补验".
Use pictorial rhythm and large sparse labels. At most those exact labels; no long paragraphs or other headings. All six labels must be spelled correctly, no duplicated stations. A harmonious self-contained research illustration.
